THEN the controller's browseMainMenu method is called with "alice" and "missions".

Scenario: adminCanListBriefs | Verifies that an administrator can list briefs.
GIVEN an administrator opens the briefs menu.
WHEN the administrator selects the list option.
THEN the controller's listEntries method is called with "alice" and "briefs".

Scenario: adminCanReadBrief | Verifies that an administrator can read a brief by its ID.
GIVEN an administrator opens the briefs menu.
WHEN the administrator selects the read option and enters ID 12.
